@startuml
title UML classes — View the staff activity report
class DetailedReportsHandler { +StaffAsync(days?): Gated<StaffReportDto> }
class StaffReportDto <<record>> { ActiveMentors CheckIns Reviews? AverageCaseload }
class MentorActivityRowDto <<record>> { MembershipId Name Cohorts Caseload CheckIns Reviews? Load }
DetailedReportsHandler ..> StaffReportDto
StaffReportDto *-- MentorActivityRowDto
@enduml
